Subject: [BACKPORT, BUILD ONLY] drm/msm: Attach a driver to GMU

Squash of patches 1–8 from Akhil P Oommen and Haitao Xu:
https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261030-gmu-sync-state-fix-v2-0-89d3082d97af@oss.qualcomm.com
Upstream series base: 5fed66a6fde4dcc6a63ecec6f32e1a331dc4e1a4.

Next24 backport: hunk context from patch 3 uses devm_kzalloc_obj at the
two callsites instead of devm_kzalloc. Both are replaced with devres_alloc
and paired devres_add, as in the posted patch. No changes to patch 6.

Not for runtime use: the posted teardown and devfreq review findings are
still open. This artifact only validates the full kernel patch/build stack.

